# Cloudflare Pages 讀此於其出之根。與 vercel.json 之 headers 同意 ——
# 囊者按其名而不易,故可永記。無此則每返之客再取十六兆之囊。
#
# City packs and hashed assets are content-addressed and never mutate in place,
# so they are safe to cache forever. Without this, a returning visitor
# re-downloads a 16 MB pack on every visit.
#
# 他站無害:GitHub Pages 不識之,Vercel 從其 vercel.json,此文百餘字而已。
/city-packs/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
